{"slug":"dal-5-giugno-il-primo-brunch-allitaliana-a-zurigo","lang":"it","title":"Ogni domenica Brunch all'italiana a Zurigo","subtitle":"A Zurigo arriva una grande novità. A partire da domenica 5 giugno 2022 il Komplex 457 presenterà il primo Brunch all'italiana a Zurigo sul suo terrazzo da 300m2","date":"2022-06-18T16:29:00.000Z","category":"Gastronomia","categorySlug":"gastronomia","author":"Antonio De Luca","authorPhoto":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/622edfe2de8cb601be11a898_Dydo.jpg","authorRole":"Responsabile Eventi e Spettacoli","tags":["Terrazza Komplex 457","Komplex 457","Zurigo","Brunch all'italiana"],"image":"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62adac6442bdf841cdda62df_Italian-Brunch-Komplex-457-Terrasse-Zuerich-news-Tuttoitalia.jpg","thumb":"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62adad44d632a11199fa8539_Terrasse%20Brunch%20Fenuta%20Promo%20Post.png","gallery":["https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6afc6f5388b58a2d8e4_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich7.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6ac42bdf80825da3304_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich8.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6af2377a24ec1710cc1_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich10.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6af010b9c96711a978a_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich9.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6aa274849f8ddd9aa9b_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich12.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6aa2377a239d0710c9d_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich14.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6a83287362e2df11b57_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich3.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6a8cd95dfe5d71ae679_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich5.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6a98dfd523774c513bb_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich15.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6aaf5e2cfeabdf5be18_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich16.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6a94b532a0c6dc3fad8_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich17.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62ada6aa08e0262cb5430b3c_Italian%20Brunch%20Komplex%20457%20Terrasse%20Zuerich19.jpg","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62adad44d632a11199fa8539_Terrasse%20Brunch%20Fenuta%20Promo%20Post.png","https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62794cc4633d3325de3e02b3_Komplex.jpeg"],"body":"<p>È partito il conto alla rovescia per il nuovo progetto del Komplex 457, il locale di Zurigo che solitamente ospita noti artisti italiani come recentemente Mahmood, Calcutta o in programma Sfera Ebbasta (4 giugno 2022), dal 5 giugno offrirà ogni domenica il <strong>Brunch all'italiana</strong> sul suo terrazzo \"Komplex Terrasse\", ovvero la ben nota colazione allargata che sta conquistando il palato dei buongustai di tutto il mondo.</p><p>Non mancare al prossimo Brunch all'italiana con prodotti <a href=\"https://www.fenuta.ch/\" target=\"_blank\">Fenuta Bäckerei</a> e caffè <a href=\"https://coffee-excellence.ch/easy/\" target=\"_blank\">Cecchetto</a>. Ogni domenica a Zurigo sul terrazzo del Komplex 457 da 300m2. Entrata comoda e parcheggi a volontà al Letzipark.</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://tuttoitalia.news/brunch\" target=\"_blank\"><div><img alt=\"Italian Brunch Zurich Komplex 457 Italians.ch\" src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5f82fd88166eb97cde0e507b/62adb1672748492fd3d9f727_Brunch-flyer-tuttoitalia.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></a></figure><h5>Prossimo appuntamento:</h5><p>Domenica 19 giugno 2022<br>ore 10-14<br>Komplex 457, Zurigo</p><h5>Indirizzo:</h5><p>Komplex Terrasse<br>Hohlstrasse 457<br>8048 Zurigo</p><p>Per info e prenotazioni via Whatsapp 076 499 04 57 oppure direttamente su <a href=\"https://komplex-457.ch/terrasse-brunch-reservation/\" target=\"_blank\">https://tuttoitalia.news/brunch</a></p>","videoLink":null,"versions":{}}